      "1 green bell pepper, seeded and chopped",
      "1 onion, finely chopped",
      "5-6 cloves garlic, finely minced",
      "2 (16-ounce) can black beans, rinsed and drained",
      "1 (14.5-ounce) can diced tomatoes",
