    "instructions": "Cut 1/3 of strawberries in half. Over medium high heat combine cut strawberries, sugar, and vanilla. Cook stirring occasionally until it thickens, about 5 minutes. Remove from heat. Blend about 1/3 of the sauce in a blender or with a hand mixer and then mix back into main sauce. Add remaining strawberries. Serve hot or cold."
