    "instructions": "are needed to see this picture.\nNOTE: Water should not touch bottom of the top pot\nBring water to a simmer\nPrepare Pan (9x13)\nSpray bottom with PAM\nCover with oversized piece of wax paper\nPress paper into corners\nStep 2\nPut 1 stick of butter in top of double boiler (melt halfway)\nAdd 2 cans of sweetened condensed milk\nHeat and stir until butter is completely melted (7-10 min.)\nAdd 2 tsp. of vanilla\nStep 3\nPrepare chocolate (Two 18 ounce bags)\nCut into ¼ to ½ inch pieces (will melt faster)\nAdd chocolate to melted ingredients in double boiler\nStir until chocolate is completely melted (NO LUMPS!)\nOPTIONAL (Nuts)\nHeat 2 cups of chopped walnuts in microwave for 1 min.\nAdd warm nuts to fudge in double boiler\n*Make sure when fudge is poured into the pan that it is level\nand smooth"
